# a whole night, the clock at 3x (the music as it is): the regulars come in, tunes come and go (every note in the
# key and in the chord), someone leads, last orders, "Time", the last tune, Hugh's air alone, then a new night
wait 300
timewarp 3
wait 240000
expect minute >80
expect present >3
expect tunes >0
shot early.png
wait 240000
peakreset
wav busy.wav
wait 120000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -1
expect peak_db_min -30
expect minute >200
expect present >4
expect tunes >2
shot busy.png
tap ENV
wait 200
shot regulars.png
tap HOME
wait 480000
expect minute >360
shot late.png
wait 400000
expect night 2
expect tunes >5
expect badev 0
expect offkey 0
expect offchord 0
shot night2.png
tap ARP
wait 200
shot memories.png
